    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Yelemiya hakadi Nebukadenesâ, mukelenge wa Babulona, ne masalayi andi onso ne makelenge onso a hanshi ha buloba bakadi muinshi mua bukokeshi buandi ne ba mu bisamba bionso, baluangana ne Yelushalema ne misoko yau yonso: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Ya wambile Sedekiya, mukelenge wa Yuda, ne, Yehowa udi wamba ne, Monai, nenfile musoko eu mu bianza bia mukelenge wa Babulona, ne yeye neawoshe ne kahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne wewe mene kuena uhanduka mu tshianza tshiandi, kadi nebakukuate bushuwa, nebakufile ku tshianza tshiandi; neumonangane ne mukelenge wa Babulona ku mesu mene, ne yeye neayikile nʼebe mpala ne mpala mene; neuye ku Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi unvue dî dia Yehowa, wewe Sedekiya, mukelenge wa Yuda! Yehowa udi wamba dî edi bua bualu buebe ne, Wewe kuena ufua ku muele wa nvita; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neufue mu ditalala ne nebakuimbile musenga wa manananshi, bu muakoshilabo bankambua bebe ne bakelenge bakadi ku mpala kuebe; nebakuashile muadi, bamba ne, Aka, mukelenge! Bua meme nakuamba dî.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yelemiya muprofete wakambila Sedekiya, mukelenge wa Yuda, mei â onso mu Yelushalema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakadi masalayi a mukelenge wa Babulona aluangana ne Bena Yelushalema ne misoko yonso ya mu Yuda yakadi ishala, Lakisha ne Azeka; bua anu misoko ei ya Bena Yuda yakushala munkatshi mua misoko yakadi ne ngumbu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Yelemiya, hakashikisha mukelenge Sedekiya kuhunga tshihungidi ne bantu bonso bakadi mu Yelushalema bua kubambileye mukenji wa budishikaminyi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu yonso alekele muhika wandi mulume ne muhika wandi mukashi badi Bena Ebelu, baye hatuhu; bua kakuikadi Muena Yuda wabuesha muanʼabo mu buhika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baminyampala bonso ne bantu bonso bakatumikila mukenji eu, bakadi bahunga tshihungidi etshi tshia kulekela bahika babo, ne balume ne bakashi, baye hatuhu, bua kababakuatshi mu buhika kabidi; bakatumikila mukenji eu diambedi, bakabalekela ne, Baye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi ku nyima bakakudimuna muanda eu, bakahingasha bahika aba bakadibo bahikula, ne balume ne bakashi, bakababuesha mu buhika tshiakabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Yelemiya ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Nakahunga tshihungidi ne batatu benu mu dituku dinakabaluhula mu buloba bua Ejipitu, mu nsubu wa buhika mene ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumbana bidimu muanda mutekete, bunudi habu mbua kulekela, muntu ne muntu, muanʼenu wa Bena Ebelu wakudihana kunudi, ne wakunukuatshila mudimu bidimu bisambombo; nudi ne bualu bua kumulekela ne umuke kunudi hatuhu. Kadi batatu benu kabakangunvuila, kabakateleja matshu abo kundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuenu nuakukudimuka mpindiu, nuakuenza bualu ebu buakadi buakane ku mesu kuanyi, hanuakumanyishangana dî dia budishikaminyi, muntu ne muntu ne muena mutumba nʼandi, ne hanuakuhunga mei bua muanda eu mu nsubu udibo bambikidila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nuakukudimuka ne nuakuhetula dina dianyi, nuakudihingashila, muntu ne muntu, bahika banuakadi balekele, balume ne bakashi, ne nuakubabuesha mu buhika tshiakabidi bua kuikalabo bahika benu, balume ne bakashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yehowa udi wamba ne, Kanuakutumikila dî dianyi bua kumanyishangana dî dia budishikaminyi, muntu yonso kudi muanʼabo, ne muntu yonso kudi muena mutumba nʼandi. Monai, ndi nnumanyisha dî dia budishikaminyi, bua nuenu kufua ku muele wa nvita, ku tshihuhu ne ku tshiole; nennuvuishe bu tshintu tshidi tshikuatshisha makelenge onso ha buloba buowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi ngamba bua bantu bakushiha tshihungidi tshianyi, badi kabayi benze bu muakambabo mu tshihungidi atshi tshiakahungabo ku mpala kuanyi, hakahandabo muana wa ngombe nseke ibidi ne hakahitshilabo munkatshi mua nseke ei; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baminyampala ba Bena Yuda ne ba Yelushalema mene, bantu babo batungula, bakuidi ne bantu bonso ba mu buloba ebu bakahitshila munkatshi mua nseke ibidi ya muana wa ngombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbobo bandi ngamba ne, Nembafile mu bianza bia badi nʼabo lukuna, ne mu bianza bia badi bakeba mioyo yabo. Bitalu biabo nebikale bia kudia bia nyunyu ya mulu ne bia nyama ya ha buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenfile Sedekiya, mukelenge wa Yuda, ne baminyampala bandi mu bianza bia bena lukuna babo, ne mu bianza bia badi bakeba mioyo yabo ne mu bianza bia masalayi a mukelenge wa Babulona akumuka kunudi tshituha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa udi wamba ne, Monai, ndi ngela mukenji, nengahingashe ku musoko eu, nealuangane ne benʼau, neabatambe bukole, neawoshe ne kahia; ne nenvuishe misoko ya mu Yuda bu bikulu, kayiyi ne bantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
